cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "cancer-lineage-state-dynamics"
abstract: >-
  Computational analysis of phenotypic inheritance, state occupancy and switching
  dynamics in cancer lineage tracing. Separates across-clone variance in state
  occupancy from across-clone variance in switching kinetics, establishes the
  identifiability window within which a lineage tree can resolve a switching rate,
  and benchmarks the estimators against PATH, PASTRI and the OUwie engine.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Mittal"
    given-names: "Prateek"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/REPLACE_OWNER/cancer-lineage-state-dynamics"
keywords:
  - lineage tracing
  - CRISPR recorders
  - cell-state plasticity
  - identifiability
  - metastasis
  - phylogenetics
  - cancer evolution
